Subject: Re: [stan-users] WBIC in rstan
Message-ID: <AJkT25rHMI0.fAJx3VH_MAkJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <AJkT25rHMI0.gnDDUE2AiR4J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <AJkT25rHMI0.uyu6U9fSZ58J@stan-users.groups.google.com> <AJkT25rHMI0.gnDDUE2AiR4J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
