From ucab04b8f0759c712 at groups.google.com  Wed Mar  4 18:56:42 2015
From: ucab04b8f0759c712 at groups.google.com (Daniel Lee)
Date: Wed, 04 Mar 2015 18:56:42 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] Dump data from R
Message-ID: <6QXywtGEvZ8.5Upo7E7dNa4J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
