Date: Fri, 06 Mar 2015 09:03:16 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] Re: multi-logit distribution (for hierarchical HMM transition prior)
Message-ID: <pIEJOTEtbAU.iLzOFDzxk4oJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
