Oh, then you can do the same thing, but with the
whole matrix.  You'll need to flatten it into a vector
if you want to have covariance.  Or you can just
pool per transition without allowing covariance across
states.  Or you can use a Dirichlet for each transition
probability simplex if you don't care about covariance.

- Bob

