Subject: fitting multiple sets of data with same model
Message-ID: <dP3mYsoBycc.m0PaBAoXGZgJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/dP3mYsoBycc/m/m0PaBAoXGZgJ>
