Date: Tue, 10 Mar 2015 23:24:18 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] Identification of multinomial (by means of Poisson) IRT/ideal point model
Message-ID: <pt34sBaCHk8.sHLmQCLPgf8J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <pt34sBaCHk8.chmkUtE9vNsJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <pt34sBaCHk8.H5nJMYyapMcJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <pt34sBaCHk8.chmkUtE9vNsJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
