Hi Cameron,

You can put constraints on vectors if they are the same for each data element of the vector. In your case, z should be declare as:
    vector<lower=0>[rows(y)] z;

See page 219-220 in stan-reference-2.6.0.pdf in "23.4 Vector and Matrix Data Types."

Daniel

