> >  }
> >  increment_log_prob(log_sum_exp(ps));
> > }
> >
> >
> > I had my suspicion about this line. I thought it was a "smart" idea to vectorize it, instead of looping over the components, but I guess I have misunderstood what increment_log_prob does.
