From u743bbacc59f4b25f at groups.google.com  Wed Mar 11 20:28:07 2015
From: u743bbacc59f4b25f at groups.google.com (Ben Goodrich)
Date: Wed, 11 Mar 2015 20:28:07 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] Re: Silent reject statement
Message-ID: <y0X029wPjJM.tibMnRl86r0J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <y0X029wPjJM.VIgYgV2lqAEJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <y0X029wPjJM.6f9p17WH32UJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <y0X029wPjJM.VIgYgV2lqAEJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/y0X029wPjJM/m/tibMnRl86r0J>
