Date: Sat, 14 Mar 2015 10:05:58 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] Modeling reaction time data with shifted log normal hierarchical model
Message-ID: <xv-Yjpb7faw.G0vgijfg9oQJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <xv-Yjpb7faw.o7SHlrAH7sUJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <xv-Yjpb7faw.O9cydg8NI8sJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <xv-Yjpb7faw.o7SHlrAH7sUJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
