Subject: Define vector of integers in Parameters block
Message-ID: <PfDIGcDeVG4.qmg5MLbmUg4J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/PfDIGcDeVG4/m/qmg5MLbmUg4J>
