If you're running in RStan, it's

  control=list(stepsize=0.1)

- Bob

> On Mar 29, 2015, at 6:19 AM, Yael Karlinsky <yael.ka...@gmail.com> wrote:
>
> Hi again,
>
> I implemented the Cholesky part, so my remaining question is how to specify the initial step size.
>
> Thank you!
> Yael
